<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112331" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρικτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρίσσω</span>)
		(misspelt <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φικτρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Osl.</u>
					1.261
				</span></i>
			), <i>to be shuddered at, awful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῆς ἴδες ἱερὰ φρικτῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Aet.</u>
					3.1.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				14.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cic.</u>
				49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.110
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.524.22
			</span></i>, Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.117
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">B., <u>PMasp.</u>97 ii
				51</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοί</span>]
			prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.17
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Num.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					10.440e
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					6.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bristling with spears,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρῶν ὄχλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ezek.
					<u>Exag.</u>
					197
				</span></i>
			.</div>
